<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>AI工具与模型HOT</title><link>https://ai-tool-model-hot.pages.dev/</link><description>每天从 21 个信源（18 个 RSS + 3 个 Hugging Face 组织页）收 AI 模型发布与主流智能体更新，按规则打分精选，只显示标题、一句简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:10:37 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>GPT-6 模型展现出内在的蛋白质设计能力</title><link>https://openai.com/index/gpt-6-models-demonstrate-intrinsic-protein-design-capabilities</link><description>GPT-6 仅凭推理与代码就能设计蛋白质结构与序列，实验室测试在五个靶点上都观察到了结合迹象。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">3c6728c1bfd198791155e7911f8c578086a9a218</guid><source url="https://openai.com/index/gpt-6-models-demonstrate-intrinsic-protein-design-capabilities">OpenAI News</source></item><item><title>OpenAI Agents SDK v1.0.0-alpha.2 发布</title><link>https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/releases/tag/v1.0.0-alpha.2</link><description>OpenAI Agents SDK 推出 v1.0.0-alpha.2 预览版，继续为 1.0 正式版打磨智能体开发工具链。</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 20:04:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">33a235a91126265f95e28d3e243eeb06a69dcb5f</guid><source url="https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/releases/tag/v1.0.0-alpha.2">OpenAI Agents SDK Releases</source></item><item><title>OpenAI Agents SDK v0.26.0</title><link>https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/releases/tag/v0.26.0</link><description>Agents SDK 发布 0.26.0，把 GPT-Live 演示升级到 1.1，并修了外部服务商示例的版本兼容与 Docker 资源限制问题。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 03:22:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">0d1de3d8faa044560b468666d65806f6d0906d89</guid><source url="https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/releases/tag/v0.26.0">OpenAI Agents SDK Releases</source></item><item><title>Pydantic AI v2.74.0 发布</title><link>https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.74.0</link><description>Pydantic AI 2.74.0 在核心中加入计算机操作工具契约，智能体可以直接调用 ComputerTool 完成电脑操作。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:24:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">0f7a3c43cc177f44de084d995ed5d535246a68af</guid><source url="https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.74.0">Pydantic AI Releases</source></item><item><title>Claude Code 2.1.331</title><link>https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-331</link><description>Claude Code 2.1.331 把 Code Mode 扩展到四大云平台的终端会话（Bedrock、谷歌云、Foundry 与 AWS 上的 Claude），同时应用网关新增了 OIDC 用户组配置。</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:40:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">d72bcce9f05f1c62d6aaa9034205be58cf3bee25</guid><source url="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-331">Claude Code Changelog</source></item><item><title>Gemini CLI v0.71.1 发布</title><link>https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.71.1</link><description>这是一次补丁版本，将一处修复合入 v0.71.0 发布线，解决该版本的问题。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 03:50:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">56d5c7c32a87562e6a0670aedfac0013cca21586</guid><source url="https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.71.1">Gemini CLI Releases</source></item><item><title>Pydantic AI v1.107.11 发布</title><link>https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v1.107.11</link><description>Pydantic AI 1.x 分支迎来小版本更新，以常规修复为主。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:24:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">031724e287b2f316c2a726ed5cc4936da663b1ef</guid><source url="https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v1.107.11">Pydantic AI Releases</source></item><item><title>Claude Code 2.1.332 版本更新</title><link>https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-332</link><description>Claude Code 2.1.332 支持从 MCP 服务器加载技能（测试版），并新增 PreSkillShellCommand 钩子，可在执行前拦截技能或命令的内联脚本。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 01:37:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">330d71ac80d9c0c0a46667c296959a0a855a7907</guid><source url="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-332">Claude Code Changelog</source></item><item><title>Qwen Code v1.0.0-preview.2 发布</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-preview.2</link><description>Qwen Code 发布 v1.0.0-preview.2：订阅目录新增 Qwen4-Max（百万上下文，支持图片与视频输入），额度用尽时显示重置倒计时，并新增 /upgrade 命令直达订阅页。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:37:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">95160328cc4fe2ad2ae00ff0a82416b4fbf35e81</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-preview.2">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>OpenCode v2.4.1</title><link>https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/releases/tag/v2.4.1</link><description>开源终端智能体 OpenCode 发布 v2.4.1，本次未附详细更新说明。</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 14:55:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">1a4c49f79da937233c521a4d96c03e2e9d3dbdec</guid><source url="https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/releases/tag/v2.4.1">OpenCode Releases</source></item><item><title>用智能体团队与形式化验证寻找更快的量子算法</title><link>https://deepmind.google/blog/finding-faster-quantum-algorithms-with-agents-and-formal-verification</link><description>DeepMind 用多智能体协作加形式化验证，为聚变与化学问题找到更快的量子算法。</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 16:59:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">61dcf1169479ac822b31a5cef7d46fd39c77927b</guid><source url="https://deepmind.google/blog/finding-faster-quantum-algorithms-with-agents-and-formal-verification">Google DeepMind Blog</source></item><item><title>智能体连续跑几天：Kiro CLI 如今跟得上</title><link>https://kiro.dev/blog/agents-run-for-days</link><description>Kiro CLI 强化了长时任务能力，让智能体可以连续多日稳定运行而不掉线。</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 18:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">5c50d7dff9ae90e4103c610444deb774aecc2e86</guid><source url="https://kiro.dev/blog/agents-run-for-days">Kiro Blog</source></item><item><title>Agent Lake：把智能体运行轨迹变成可复用的改进资产</title><link>https://www.langchain.com/blog/the-agent-lake</link><description>LangSmith 推出 Agent Lake，把智能体产生的全部运行轨迹集中起来，从中筛出高价值信号，转化为修复建议与微调数据。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 01:32:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">1413cdfc6eb60a484af064e283b759c6661db392</guid><source url="https://www.langchain.com/blog/the-agent-lake">LangChain Blog</source></item><item><title>更懂你的 Google Search：专属个性化搜索来了</title><link>https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/search/google-search-personal-intelligence-apps</link><description>Google Search 推出 Personal Intelligence，结合 Gmail、Drive、相册等应用信息，给出更贴合个人的搜索结果。</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 17:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">39c2da17cef629dc0ff59477ab693d20baff014a</guid><source url="https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/search/google-search-personal-intelligence-apps">Google AI Blog</source></item><item><title>RoboTrack：面向真实机器人操作的点追踪</title><link>https://huggingface.co/blog/allenai/robotrack</link><description>AllenAI 发布 RoboTrack 评测与 1500 万条仿真点轨迹数据，并推出两个点追踪模型，帮助机器人在抓取、移液等操作中更稳地跟住目标点。</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 17:20:37 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">ca38829e731287133c5ce858c81137975894da48</guid><source url="https://huggingface.co/blog/allenai/robotrack">Hugging Face Blog</source></item><item><title>OpenAI 与 Cisco 推出 Shirudo</title><link>https://openai.com/index/introducing-shirudo</link><description>OpenAI 与 Cisco 联合发布开源 Linux 运行时 Shirudo，帮助团队在滚动部署补丁期间依然守住正在运行的系统。</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:20:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">1d0c151fefed0deaf7f3ec56aad3faaff42e5184</guid><source url="https://openai.com/index/introducing-shirudo">OpenAI News</source></item><item><title>Gemini CLI v0.72.0 预览版发布</title><link>https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.72.0-preview.0</link><description>Gemini CLI 发布 v0.72.0 预览版，修复嵌套 .gitignore 规则与 Windows 家目录路径处理，会话恢复改为回到最近活跃的会话，A2A 服务器也加上鉴权与输入校验。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:34:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">970c98f4c81a818c502eb1df9c664b31ce7189e3</guid><source url="https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.72.0-preview.0">Gemini CLI Releases</source></item><item><title>用 Astra 搜寻遥远行星</title><link>https://openai.com/index/searching-for-distant-planets-with-astra</link><description>两位业余天文学家借助 Codex 与 Astra，在 NASA 开普勒和 TESS 望远镜的公开数据里寻找系外行星候选体。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f3aa9260f1094b3713b95db83158321ea63632fb</guid><source url="https://openai.com/index/searching-for-distant-planets-with-astra">OpenAI News</source></item><item><title>Clay 借助 Codex 与 ChatGPT 帮销售团队赢单</title><link>https://openai.com/business/customer-stories/clay-plugins-openai</link><description>Clay 把 Codex 与 ChatGPT 接入销售工作流，帮用户调研客户、把数据变成可落地的获客打法，背后的推理交给 GPT-6 模型。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">99b93f3e10984935a6ab283857e5b97c678a706d</guid><source url="https://openai.com/business/customer-stories/clay-plugins-openai">OpenAI News</source></item><item><title>Pydantic AI v2.72.0 发布</title><link>https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.72.0</link><description>Pydantic AI 发布 2.72.0，调用已被 Anthropic 或 OpenAI 下线的模型时会发出弃用警告，同时补齐 Agent 指令覆盖、实时语音指令与工具参数别名等更新。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:38:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">461d865018fda0d1bb56ffa7054375160734c62a</guid><source url="https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.72.0">Pydantic AI Releases</source></item></channel></rss>
